1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,360
(Leonard:)Anyway, I'm not sure
she's the best fit

2
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:06,010
(Leonard:)for our little-- how should
we call it-- rebel alliance.

3
00:00:06,010 --> 00:00:09,400
(Sheldon:)Oh, I never identified
with the rebel alliance.

4
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:11,820
(Sheldon:)Despite their tendency
to build Death Stars,

5
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:14,070
(Sheldon:)I've always been more
of an empire man.

6
00:00:15,990 --> 00:00:17,020
(Leonard:)Yeah, not my point.

7
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:18,240
(Sheldon:)I know what your point is.

8
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:20,290
(Sheldon:)You're intimidated
by Amy's intellect.

9
00:00:20,290 --> 00:00:22,750
(Sheldon:)To that I say, buck up.

10
00:00:22,750 --> 00:00:23,960
(Leonard:)Okay, let me just

11
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:25,050
(Leonard:)get right to it.

12
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:28,380
(Leonard:)Amy is judgmental,
sanctimonious and frankly...

13
00:00:28,390 --> 00:00:31,650
(Leonard:)just obnoxious.

14
00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:33,420
(Sheldon:)So?

15
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:35,810
(Leonard:)So we already have
you for all that.

16
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:40,400
(Sheldon:)Are you suggesting I terminate
my relationship with Amy?

17
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:41,810
(Leonard:)No, no, of course not.

18
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:44,900
(Leonard:)Just have your relationship
someplace else.

19
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:48,520
(Sheldon:)May I point out that
for eight long months,

20
00:00:48,520 --> 00:00:51,390
(Sheldon:)I suffered in silence
as your female companion

21
00:00:51,390 --> 00:00:53,610
(Sheldon:)filled our apartment with her

22
00:00:53,610 --> 00:00:56,450
(Sheldon:)off-key country music caterwauling,

23
00:00:56,450 --> 00:00:57,900
(Sheldon:)the unappetizing spectacle

24
00:00:57,900 --> 00:01:01,580
(Sheldon:)of her grinding a pumice stone
against her calloused feet

